# =============================================================================
# MEDIBOT Root Environment Configuration - EXAMPLE FILE
# =============================================================================
# This is a root-level example file for reference
# The actual configuration should be in backend/.env and frontend/.env

# =============================================================================
# QUICK SETUP GUIDE
# =============================================================================
# 1. Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env
# 2. Copy frontend/.env.example to frontend/.env
# 3. Fill in your actual API keys and configuration values
# 4. Never commit .env files to version control

# =============================================================================
# REQUIRED API KEYS & SERVICES
# =============================================================================

# MongoDB Database
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/medibot

# AI Services
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here
TAVILY_API_KEY=your_tavily_api_key_here
PINECONE_API_KEY=your_pinecone_api_key_here
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_elevenlabs_api_key_here

# Google Calendar Integration
GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID=your_calendar_id_here@group.calendar.google.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id_here
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret_here

# Security
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_key_here_minimum_32_characters_long

# =============================================================================
# SERVICE SETUP LINKS
# =============================================================================
# Google Gemini API: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
# OpenRouter API: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# Tavily Search API: https://tavily.com/
# Pinecone Vector DB: https://app.pinecone.io/
# ElevenLabs TTS: https://elevenlabs.io/
# Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# MongoDB Atlas: https://cloud.mongodb.com/

# =============================================================================
# ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW
# =============================================================================
# This MediBot application uses:
# - Multi-agent AI architecture with intent classification
# - Vector database for FAQ semantic search
# - Real-time web search for medical information
# - Automated appointment booking with calendar integration
# - Multi-language support (English, Tamil, Spanish, French, Hindi)
# - Comprehensive error handling and fallback mechanisms

# =============================================================================
# DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST
# =============================================================================
# □ All API keys configured
# □ MongoDB database accessible
# □ Google Calendar service account created and shared
# □ Pinecone index created with dimension 768
# □ Backend server running on port 3004
# □ Frontend React app running on port 3000
# □ Calendar integration tested
# □ FAQ system populated with medical documents
# □ Web search functionality verified
# □ Appointment booking workflow tested